    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f234059393010858",
      "translationZh": "AI Engineer NYC 常规门票最后召集！作为 Latent Space 订阅者的专属福利，前 30 位可以领取一个优惠 30% 的折扣码，希望能帮到你们——仅限新购门票，不接受退款！2 周后见！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23da1747e4fb13ca",
      "translationZh": "虽然我们在播客中通常关注业界，但每隔一段时间，我们也会重点介绍一位明显正在崭露头角的超级明星博士。2024 年，我们邀请了 Shunyu Yao，他后来在 OpenAI 打造了 Operator，如今是 Tencent 的首席 AI 科学家。2025 年，我们邀请了 Jack Morris，他后来联合创办了估值 6 亿的 Engram，如今是持续学习领域的重要发声者。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5a62db279eabe44",
      "translationZh": "今年，我们很荣幸能介绍 MIT 的 Alex Zhang 的工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "561751c7f4e33c4c",
      "translationZh": "从 GPU 内核和 KernelBench，到递归语言模型（Recursive Language Models）、Mismanaged Geniuses，再到大规模多智能体群，Alex Zhang 正在探索：当我们用原始简陋的系统来封装日益强大的模型时，究竟有多少能力未被充分发挥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42a52d09665b0e00",
      "translationZh": "今年年初，RLMs 刷屏了社交媒体时间线：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e2209709f2914f6",
      "translationZh": "而一个基于 RLM 的运行框架，在 OpenAI 的 Astra 之前，率先近乎解决了 ARC-AGI-3：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a08446b98302df7c",
      "translationZh": "即便到了今天，它仍在影响新的研究，而这些研究的潜在影响比 RLMs 更为极端：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a98e8e5aefc9663",
      "translationZh": "我们深入探讨了 GPU Mode 和 AI 编写的内核、研究品味，以及为什么学术界应该押注那些业界实验室不愿押注的方向；还讨论了 GEV、标准自回归语言模型的替代方案，以及将运行框架视为组合式泛化器的理念。Alex 解释了 RLMs、上下文卸载、以编程方式调用子智能体、Prime Agent、持久化子智能体，以及为什么未来的“语言模型”实际上可能是隐藏在简单界面之下、不可见的智能体群。我们还讨论了 OpenAI 的大规模智能体实验、Kimi 智能体群、Sakana AI 的开放式研究、推测性程序化工具调用、能力悬余、Neuralese，以及 Alex 认为下一个重大研究机会可能出现在哪里。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aae5e1ff1c51533a",
      "translationZh": "为什么 AI 生成的 GPU 内核仍为人类专业能力留下了巨大空间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "477291dd515731d2",
      "translationZh": "一条专家洞见如何有可能替代海量的暴力 token 搜索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15799cd7cb84e997",
      "translationZh": "为什么博士生应该押注那些起初看起来微不足道、古怪或毫无意义的研究方向",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5ae75ff9fcc4dc4",
      "translationZh": "SWE-bench、RLMs、ReAct 和 Quiet-STaR 揭示了怎样的研究品味",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca76f69e6b959b04",
      "translationZh": "GEV，以及为什么语言模型不一定意味着自回归的文本到文本解码器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20c9af93fb7c3ebb",
      "translationZh": "为什么 Claude Code、Codex 和 Pi 在结构上比表面看起来更相似",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1d47d61219ae12c",
      "translationZh": "执行框架设计如何提升跨任务、跨领域的组合泛化能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8087ad7e95f7f9bd",
      "translationZh": "RLMs：上下文卸载、代码执行、递归子智能体和共享内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "849ee2bfc410fd48",
      "translationZh": "Prime Agent、持续运行的智能体框架，以及持久的智能体间通信",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "def8f5c93b6ac952",
      "translationZh": "为什么你未来查询的模型，背后可能其实是一整个智能体群或支撑框架",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cda7250d28aaf111",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 的 10,000 个智能体实验、130B 个输出 token，以及 ~40M 等效的问题求解",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9da9c4010432e30e",
      "translationZh": "为什么智能体群中的大量搜索可能是徒劳的——以及为什么收敛仍然很难",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ece62ce0fca1232c",
      "translationZh": "Kimi 与 OpenAI 的对比，以及多智能体系统的不同实现路径",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5ad5c6198911434",
      "translationZh": "开放性、Sakana AI，以及从海量生成成果中发现隐藏的瑰宝",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92d209ab39d7d3a8",
      "translationZh": "为什么当前的前沿模型可能已经拥有大量尚未释放的能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db7fcee9f34999d4",
      "translationZh": "推测式程序化工具调用，以及让工具执行与生成过程重叠进行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2807e287c6d51eca",
      "translationZh": "英语、代码或一种全新的“Neuralese”是否会限制模型的推理方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42bda7111d7ac76a",
      "translationZh": "用于科学研究的 AI、快速演进的基准测试，以及 Alex 如何选择值得押注的研究问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "267270e57ec0f47e",
      "translationZh": "网站：alexzhang13.github.io",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
