      "translationZh": "Alex Zhang [00:07:31]：是的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "763bbf514d4dbbc5",
      "translationZh": "Swyx [00:07:31]：然后，比如说，如果图里有哪一部分我不理解，我就会一直研究，直到理解为止。否则，我，那是不允许的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
